.eggs/
# Python build artefacts. These are ROOT-SCOPED on purpose: a bare `lib/`
# matches at any depth, and it was silently excluding the whole of
# `web/src/lib/` — api.ts, data.ts, theme.ts and types.ts, without which the web
# app cannot build from a fresh clone. Nothing had ever been committed from that
# directory. Same class of mistake as the blanket `*.ply` rule; see
# docs/repo_review.md finding 2.
/build/
/dist/
/develop-eggs/
/downloads/
/eggs/
/lib/
/lib64/
/parts/
/sdist/
/var/
/wheels/
share/python-wheels/
MANIFEST
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

