# 3D assets (large)
#
# The web app ships precomputed sample meshes and they must be committed, or a
# fresh clone renders an empty viewer with no error. The blanket rule below hid
# them once already; the negation has to come after the rule to take effect.
*.ply
*.obj
*.glb
*.gltf
*.fbx
*.stl
*.usd
*.usdz
*.blend
*.blend1

# ...except the web app's shipped samples, which are the demo.
!web/public/samples/**

